CNK&=& \frac{ \beta - \gamma }{   \beta + \gamma  } \frac{ \sigma^2 }{2} \left(\frac{- \beta - \gamma}{\sigma^2}  \right) = - \frac{\beta - \gamma}{2}
\end{eqnarray} 
