B&=& \frac{C N K e^{Nt} - KM +N}{C N e^{Nt} - M} = \frac{ - \frac{\beta - \gamma}{2} e^{- \gamma t} + \frac{ \beta + \gamma}{2} - \gamma }{ \frac{ \beta - \gamma }{   \beta + \gamma  } \frac{ \sigma^2 }{2} e^{- \gamma t} -  \frac{\sigma^2}{2}  } \\
